<Page title="Disclaimer" description="CricScience is educational. It is not coaching, medical or physiotherapy advice." lede="CricScience is for learning. It is not a substitute for a qualified coach, doctor or physiotherapist.">
  <p>The lessons explain research and principles. They are not personal coaching or medical advice. Changes to a bowling action, training load or return from injury should be made with a qualified coach and, where relevant, a medical professional — especially for young players.</p>
  <p>The labs are simplified physics models for illustration and are not accurate predictions of any real delivery or shot.</p>
  <p>References to the Laws of Cricket describe the MCC's published Laws; always check the current Laws and the playing conditions for your competition. Names of players, manufacturers and technology systems are used descriptively; CricScience is not affiliated with any of them.</p>
</Page>
